<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>프로필 사이트 만들기</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color : hsl(216, 100%, 92%);
            display : flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            }
        
        h3 {color : rgb(80, 80, 255);}
        .card {
            width : 400px;
            height: auto;
            background-color: white;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 15px;

        }
        .favorite-image {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            background-image: url("/chiikawa.png");
            background-size: contain;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            margin: 10px auto;
        }
        th {
            background-color: rgb(179, 215, 255);
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h3>나의 프로필</h3>
        <hr>

        <p>이름 : <%= name %></p>
        <p>학번 : <%= id %></p>
        <p>학과 : <%= major %></p>
        <p>취미 : <%= hobby %></p>
        <p>연락처 : <%= mail %></p>
        <p>좋아하는 것 : <%= favorite %></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="favorite-image"></div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>과목 시간표</h3>
        
        <table>
        <caption> 2학기 B반 </caption>
        <tr>
            <th>월</th>
            <th>화</th>
            <th>수</th>
            <th>목</th>
            <th>금</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>사물인터넷실습</td>
            <td> </td>
            <td>클라우드컴퓨팅</td>
            <td>PCB설계실습</td>
            <td>리눅스개론</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>웹개발실습</td>
            <td> </td>
            <td>C/C++프로그래밍</td>
            <td> </td>
            <td> </td>
        </tr>
        </table>
        <a href="https://www.inhatc.ac.kr" >인하공업전문대학 홈페이지</a>
    </div>
    
<p>접속 날짜 : <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('ko-KR', {timeZone: 'Asia/Seoul'}) %></p>
</body>
</html>